1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,145
Now the ending.

2
00:00:01,145 --> 00:00:03,645
Reading one: virtue has won.

3
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:07,786
She has mastered the feeling, so she can safely invite him back.

4
00:00:07,786 --> 00:00:14,908
Reading two: what she has overcome is her resistance, and being very nice to him is a promise.

5
00:00:14,908 --> 00:00:22,473
Reading three: Chopin arranged the words so that both fit, and handed the moral judgement to us.

6
00:00:22,473 --> 00:00:29,166
In the exam, give the readings, the evidence for each, and say why the ending is left open.

